WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.467 --> 00:00:02.734
-We don't always have enough
time to cover everything

00:00:02.734 --> 00:00:04.567
in the recent news,
so, here with a recap is one

00:00:04.567 --> 00:00:06.133
of our writers, Amber Ruffin,

00:00:06.133 --> 00:00:08.334
in a segment we call
"Amber Says What."

00:00:08.334 --> 00:00:10.767
♪♪
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:10.767 --> 00:00:13.834
-You guys,
things have been crazy!

00:00:13.834 --> 00:00:14.968
Okay, first of all,

00:00:14.968 --> 00:00:17.734
Beyoncé announced
her Renaissance World Tour

00:00:17.734 --> 00:00:19.133
and I was like, "What?!"
-Whoo!

00:00:19.133 --> 00:00:22.200
-Then tickets went on sale
and I was like, "What, what?!"

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:24.567
[ Laughter ]
So, I went online to buy
a ticket and I was like,

00:00:24.567 --> 00:00:26.200
"Wha-a-a-t?!"
[ Laughter ]

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:29.167
These prices were so expensive!

00:00:29.167 --> 00:00:31.968
I was like, like, "Who you think
you got, Beyoncé?!"

00:00:31.968 --> 00:00:32.901
[ Laughter ]

00:00:32.901 --> 00:00:34.601
What's that?
They do?

00:00:34.601 --> 00:00:36.234
Oh, I'll take 14 tickets.

00:00:36.234 --> 00:00:38.400
[ Laughter ]
Sold out?
Dang!

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:41.367
So then I heard that
the Kansas City Chiefs

00:00:41.367 --> 00:00:44.334
and the Philadelphia Eagles
were going to the Super Bowl

00:00:44.334 --> 00:00:46.033
and I was like, "What?"

00:00:46.033 --> 00:00:48.667
[ Laughter ]
But then I heard
Rihanna's performing

00:00:48.667 --> 00:00:50.534
at the halftime show
and I was like --

00:00:50.534 --> 00:00:52.467
[ To Rihanna's "Work" ]
♪ What what what what what ♪

00:00:52.467 --> 00:00:53.300
Yeah, baby!

00:00:53.300 --> 00:00:55.934
The Chiefs and the Eagles
are not going to the Super Bowl.

00:00:55.934 --> 00:00:57.934
They're opening for Rihanna!

00:00:57.934 --> 00:00:58.868
[ Laughter, cheering,
and applause ]

00:00:58.868 --> 00:01:01.167
Then I heard that Florida banned

00:01:01.167 --> 00:01:05.167
AP African American studies
from their high schools

00:01:05.167 --> 00:01:07.033
and I was like, "What?!"

00:01:07.033 --> 00:01:09.100
These mother[bleep] said it...

00:01:09.100 --> 00:01:12.133
[ Laughter ]

00:01:12.133 --> 00:01:14.267
...and was like, "What?!"

00:01:14.267 --> 00:01:16.400
[ Laughter ]
Then I realized, hey!

00:01:16.400 --> 00:01:19.200
I love Black history and this
decision kind of makes me

00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:23.100
like a little, um,
Black history criminal, right?

00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:24.701
I was like, "Wha-a-a-t?!"

00:01:24.701 --> 00:01:27.334
I'm going to sneak children
Black history on the low.

00:01:27.334 --> 00:01:28.534
[ Laughter ]

00:01:28.534 --> 00:01:31.267
I'm a little Black history
Underground Railroad.

00:01:31.267 --> 00:01:34.234
[ Laughter ]
Psst! Hey, kid, c'mere.

00:01:34.234 --> 00:01:35.434
You want some Black history?

00:01:35.434 --> 00:01:37.534
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:37.534 --> 00:01:41.300
Madam C.J. Walker was the first
Black woman millionaire.

00:01:41.300 --> 00:01:43.434
Now, scram,
and tell all your friends!

00:01:43.434 --> 00:01:44.834
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:44.834 --> 00:01:48.000
Then I thought, "Well, at least
Florida can't get any worse."

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:50.634
But then I saw that the mayor
of Miami unveiled

00:01:50.634 --> 00:01:53.067
a new Black History Month

00:01:53.067 --> 00:01:56.133
police car and I was like,
"What?!"

00:01:56.133 --> 00:01:58.167
[ Laughter ]
Psst! Hey, kid.

00:01:58.167 --> 00:01:59.634
You want some more
Black history?

00:01:59.634 --> 00:02:01.167
Sure you do.
Now, you're hooked.

00:02:01.167 --> 00:02:03.167
[ Laughter ]

00:02:03.167 --> 00:02:05.968
The origins of modern day
policing can be traced back

00:02:05.968 --> 00:02:08.000
to something called
the Slave Patrol.

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:10.000
Now, scram,
and tell all your friends!

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:10.868
[ Laughter ]

00:02:10.868 --> 00:02:15.901
So, then I saw there was a new
dating reality show about MILFs,

00:02:15.901 --> 00:02:18.400
called "MILF Manor,"

00:02:18.400 --> 00:02:19.868
[ Laughter ]
and I was like, "What?!"

00:02:19.868 --> 00:02:20.868
Is this a joke?

00:02:20.868 --> 00:02:22.567
I know I've heard this
somewhere before.

00:02:22.567 --> 00:02:24.934
Like didn't one of our writers,
John Lutz,

00:02:24.934 --> 00:02:26.501
have something to do with it?

00:02:26.501 --> 00:02:28.334
And then I remembered.

00:02:28.334 --> 00:02:29.434
-Welcome to the MILF finals.
-Alright, Deborah!

00:02:29.434 --> 00:02:31.000
-Oh, you suck, Deborah.

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:32.567
-This show is the worst.

00:02:32.567 --> 00:02:35.367
Didn't one of those MILFs die
during production?

00:02:35.367 --> 00:02:36.534
-She had too much champagne

00:02:36.534 --> 00:02:38.067
and a monkey knocked her
into some quicksand.

00:02:38.067 --> 00:02:39.701
It could've happened anywhere.

00:02:39.701 --> 00:02:41.534
I was like, , "Wha-a-a-t?!"

00:02:41.534 --> 00:02:42.868
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:42.868 --> 00:02:45.634
"30 Rock" predicted the future.

00:02:45.634 --> 00:02:49.300
[ Laughter ]
Also, Lutz's name
on the show was Lutz.

00:02:49.300 --> 00:02:51.868
This man was born
with a name so funny

00:02:51.868 --> 00:02:54.467
that some of the best comedy
writers could not beat it.

00:02:54.467 --> 00:02:58.100
[ Laughter ]
So then I read that Connecticut
might exonerate women

00:02:58.100 --> 00:03:01.801
who were executed
for being witches in the 1600s

00:03:01.801 --> 00:03:03.434
and I was like, "What?!"

00:03:03.434 --> 00:03:06.534
[ Laughter ]
You're exonerating them now?

00:03:06.534 --> 00:03:08.400
It's 400 years too late.

00:03:08.400 --> 00:03:11.334
[ Laughter ]
If this is how you do people
convicted of being witches,

00:03:11.334 --> 00:03:13.167
I'd hate to see how you do
people convicted

00:03:13.167 --> 00:03:14.901
of possession of marijuana.

00:03:14.901 --> 00:03:16.968
What's that?
They're still in jail? Hm.

00:03:16.968 --> 00:03:18.901
[ Laughter ]
Psst! Hey, kid, c'mere.

00:03:18.901 --> 00:03:19.968
[ Laughter ]

00:03:19.968 --> 00:03:22.667
You want some more
Black history?

00:03:22.667 --> 00:03:24.300
Black people are
four times more likely

00:03:24.300 --> 00:03:25.801
to be arrested for possession.

00:03:25.801 --> 00:03:27.634
Now, scram,
and tell all your friends!

00:03:27.634 --> 00:03:28.868
[ Laughter ]

00:03:28.868 --> 00:03:31.334
Okay, so then something
crazy happened.

00:03:31.334 --> 00:03:33.267
You know that guy,
George Santos,

00:03:33.267 --> 00:03:35.934
the congressman who got caught
telling a million lies?

00:03:35.934 --> 00:03:39.868
Well, I read that his campaign
spent more than $26,000

00:03:39.868 --> 00:03:43.100
at an Italian restaurant
and I was like, "What?!"

00:03:43.100 --> 00:03:46.667
[ Laughter ]
Everything this man does
is hilarious!

00:03:46.667 --> 00:03:49.734
[ Laughter ]
$26,000 at one restaurant?

00:03:49.734 --> 00:03:51.868
What do they serve,
Beyoncé tickets?

00:03:51.868 --> 00:03:53.701
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:53.701 --> 00:03:56.300
Then I found out that he owed
the same restaurant

00:03:56.300 --> 00:03:59.667
another $18,000
for an event he threw there

00:03:59.667 --> 00:04:02.067
and I was like, "What?!"

00:04:02.067 --> 00:04:03.767
What happens
if he doesn't pay it?

00:04:03.767 --> 00:04:06.667
Does he get his kneecaps broken
by...

00:04:06.667 --> 00:04:08.267
[ Laughter ]

00:04:08.267 --> 00:04:10.133
This man lied
about school, work,

00:04:10.133 --> 00:04:11.968
said he was Black,
said he was Jewish,

00:04:11.968 --> 00:04:15.100
all while having a face beat
to the gods

00:04:15.100 --> 00:04:17.667
[ Laughter ]
and eating thousands
of dollars of takeout.

00:04:17.667 --> 00:04:22.067
Sir, you are very bad and it
will never stop bringing me joy.

00:04:22.067 --> 00:04:23.067
[ Laughter ]

00:04:23.067 --> 00:04:24.901
Then it was Groundhog Day!

00:04:24.901 --> 00:04:26.834
And I read
that Punxsutawney Phil

00:04:26.834 --> 00:04:28.501
predicted six more weeks
of winter

00:04:28.501 --> 00:04:30.300
and I was like, "What?!"

00:04:30.300 --> 00:04:32.300
This rat don't know the weather!

00:04:32.300 --> 00:04:34.167
[ Laughter ]
Who does this groundhog
think he is?

00:04:34.167 --> 00:04:35.734
Bitch, you live in a hole!

00:04:35.734 --> 00:04:37.400
[ Laughter ]
Don't nobody wanna hear
your forecast.

00:04:37.400 --> 00:04:38.868
You don't know [bleep]!

00:04:38.868 --> 00:04:41.767
-Amber, are you just mad that he
said six more weeks of winter?

00:04:41.767 --> 00:04:43.133
-[ Faux crying ]
Yes. I'm so cold.

00:04:43.133 --> 00:04:44.968
It's no degrees outside.

00:04:44.968 --> 00:04:47.400
We don't have any degrees.

00:04:47.400 --> 00:04:48.601
[ Laughter ]

00:04:48.601 --> 00:04:49.801
Then people were like,

00:04:49.801 --> 00:04:52.067
"Did you hear Tom Brady
retired again?"

00:04:52.067 --> 00:04:54.434
And I was like, "What?!"

00:04:54.434 --> 00:04:58.000
That is crazy
because he is very football.

00:04:58.000 --> 00:04:59.934
Like it's a whole thing.

00:04:59.934 --> 00:05:03.834
Pigskin, touchdowns,
tackling field goals,

00:05:03.834 --> 00:05:06.167
touchdowns, touch-ups --
he's got it all.

00:05:06.167 --> 00:05:07.067
[ Laughter ]

00:05:07.067 --> 00:05:09.334
-Amber, do you not know
who Tom Brady is?

00:05:09.334 --> 00:05:10.234
-No, I do not.

00:05:10.234 --> 00:05:12.067
[ Laughter ]
-Oh. He played in the NFL

00:05:12.067 --> 00:05:14.100
for 23 seasons.
He's a legend.

00:05:14.100 --> 00:05:16.734
-Oh! Is he that guy who kissed
his child on the mouth

00:05:16.734 --> 00:05:17.901
and everybody hated it?

00:05:17.901 --> 00:05:19.434
[ Laughter ]

00:05:19.434 --> 00:05:20.701
-I mean, yeah, but.

00:05:20.701 --> 00:05:22.167
-[ Laughs ]
Yuck.

00:05:22.167 --> 00:05:25.133
[ Laughter ]
So, then I read
that Pope Francis said

00:05:25.133 --> 00:05:27.634
that being gay is not a crime,
but it is a sin,

00:05:27.634 --> 00:05:30.367
and I was like, "Wha-a-a-t?!"

00:05:30.367 --> 00:05:31.868
[ Laughter ]
Bitch!

00:05:31.868 --> 00:05:34.467
Now, you know what's legal
and illegal?

00:05:34.467 --> 00:05:36.634
Where were you
during "Spotlight"?

00:05:36.634 --> 00:05:39.033
[ Laughter ]
Pope, please.

00:05:39.033 --> 00:05:41.000
Psst!
Hey, kid, c'mere.

00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:42.167
[ Laughter ]

00:05:42.167 --> 00:05:44.367
You want some Black history?

00:05:44.367 --> 00:05:45.501
The first Black pope was

00:05:45.501 --> 00:05:47.300
George Santos?!

00:05:47.300 --> 00:05:50.501
[ Laughter and applause ]
Man, George Santos got into my
Black history jacket!

00:05:50.501 --> 00:05:52.133
This has been "Amber Says What."

00:05:52.133 --> 00:05:53.968
♪♪
[ Cheering and applause ]

